{
 "batchId": "b-0073",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "nl",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_af2c4cef6d687a2fc949",
   "sourceHash": "af2c4cef6d687a2fc949dd1e0ef2e146cd5336313df9cdc0dd6c09f69b529127",
   "text": "Stofwisselingsstoornissen (diabetes, obesitas, schildklieronevenwichtigheden)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a8c6231a32e9b4ff57ee",
   "sourceHash": "a8c6231a32e9b4ff57ee196151e61da600bbe87c462639fd8ae405f518d56b12",
   "text": "Gezondheidsklachten bij vrouwen (PCOS, overgang, hormonale onevenwichtigheden)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cfb7d1476d99714d2ba5",
   "sourceHash": "cfb7d1476d99714d2ba50896a010a98cd765706bd37b5efec45cd783efce793f",
   "text": "Neurologische aandoeningen (migraine, ondersteunende therapie voor de zenuwen)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a3249210527b6a71ce73",
   "sourceHash": "a3249210527b6a71ce739c40ae80c64028e09ad8754a8d42b2ae8fe293099ba9",
   "text": "Welke behandelingen en programma's biedt Kairali aan?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_97425f87c334eb228865",
   "sourceHash": "97425f87c334eb22886514582a39236ea0324e8cfd5bad39a7a9c89d990e6f25",
   "text": "Kairali biedt ayurvedische programma's aan die zijn afgestemd op uw constitutie en gezondheidsdoelen, elk met een door de arts vastgestelde minimale verblijfsduur:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a4d8185e3728fc77f55d",
   "sourceHash": "a4d8185e3728fc77f55dffa703156a41ccb0a26e725a172bcc504ffa75c1e3ce",
   "text": "Panchakarma & ontgifting — vanaf 14 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e5392772f6eb4afe452e",
   "sourceHash": "e5392772f6eb4afe452e81c0ba012ee724c5f3f98e03bfab27bbacfb48bed2e3",
   "text": "Stressverlichting & mentaal welzijn — vanaf 7 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_342f709b9f8db650f9c6",
   "sourceHash": "342f709b9f8db650f9c642c60af64f9804ecd274d3c0bcd669f03a4251178b92",
   "text": "Ondersteuning bij chronische aandoeningen (artritis, diabetes, hoge bloeddruk, luchtwegen, neurologisch) — van 7 tot 14 nachten, afhankelijk van de aandoening",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfe58a82d6dc0eaa4c1a",
   "sourceHash": "bfe58a82d6dc0eaa4c1aa863ef93db8d6e3896e350d17ce5b9c87e6c4a855b36",
   "text": "Gewichtsbeheersing & stofwisseling — vanaf 14 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0800a8f813262217a736",
   "sourceHash": "0800a8f813262217a73682e9040036c84544bf4a3342fa2c4ea75254a5aba810",
   "text": "Hormonale balans bij vrouwen & endocriene therapie — vanaf 21 nachten; herstel na de bevalling — vanaf 14 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_32b1f79c5f9f1d01a2ac",
   "sourceHash": "32b1f79c5f9f1d01a2acf9998657f76ea9cbb7eb6751667247b278224709b101",
   "text": "Zorg voor het bewegingsapparaat (rug, nek, gewrichten, wervelkolom) — vanaf 14 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0220601399ba09d85af2",
   "sourceHash": "0220601399ba09d85af2339ab8e15a3a0743b7fa9032e50d46891488e32b068a",
   "text": "Huid & chronische huidaandoeningen — vanaf 14 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3c7fed30d3aa75d07b44",
   "sourceHash": "3c7fed30d3aa75d07b44e6380029cefc80d51820f3658e761977fffb8a663455",
   "text": "Versterking van de weerstand — vanaf 7 nachten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_48071a132c51cb312876",
   "sourceHash": "48071a132c51cb31287650a31cd6237cfd7133f4b0434208c69fb9974140ab46",
   "text": "Elk programma omvat dagelijks voorgeschreven therapieën, een persoonlijk voedingsplan en sessies yoga en meditatie. Inwendige kruidengeneesmiddelen, laboratoriumonderzoek en speciale therapieën worden naar behoefte in rekening gebracht.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e747ec39cc1ec304aab6",
   "sourceHash": "e747ec39cc1ec304aab62afc50a92d83739793434790609e83959adfbcbedfe6",
   "text": "Bekijk alle programmadetails op onze [[OPEN_1]]programmapagina[[CLOSE_1]].",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a38b2345d91179e6d134",
   "sourceHash": "a38b2345d91179e6d134a22879cefe799e909f00fec4fd3c997b6de6cfcde649",
   "text": "Hoe lang moet ik verblijven voor een goed resultaat?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ab5b1ecee0f7a7a143da",
   "sourceHash": "ab5b1ecee0f7a7a143da69fe66cdcc40621bc586b86c314e1d9084d82126829b",
   "text": "De aanbevolen verblijfsduur hangt af van uw programma en wordt tijdens het consult door de arts vastgesteld:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3d645affb83b45b3bb1a",
   "sourceHash": "3d645affb83b45b3bb1a04548282e1c746b422b48427b3273ac4439e19fdc781",
   "text": "3 nachten — het programma Preventive Health & Regenerative, een kennismaking met Ayurveda",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_08869bf7e0598fc363e4",
   "sourceHash": "08869bf7e0598fc363e4965d7a68512d82736ca3322212913cbc1a583c8173d5",
   "text": "7 nachten — stressverlichting, slaap, weerstand en diverse andere programma's",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_79b98ca0ad60f347eb8c",
   "sourceHash": "79b98ca0ad60f347eb8c2db0fec1e5aecf95bddc36584f7e263b68b93ce0f226",
   "text": "14 nachten — Panchakarma, bewegingsapparaat, huid, gewichtsbeheersing en de meeste programma's voor chronische aandoeningen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4cdaf92a8f81442d9f12",
   "sourceHash": "4cdaf92a8f81442d9f12d2e6da30823bd3ae556d04fcbb366d36df259290f319",
   "text": "21 nachten — programma's voor hormonale/endocriene klachten en herstel van verslaving",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e2ddddc38ba428861464",
   "sourceHash": "e2ddddc38ba428861464a3f7edc73e209a94fb05ec9ea621bcda61c041c0b244",
   "text": "Onze artsen bevestigen tijdens het consult de exacte duur voor uw aandoening.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fa6957ccd385e4e9025f",
   "sourceHash": "fa6957ccd385e4e9025f24776ba16e69289f6d1cc4d4e2154ff6ff0cc058293e",
   "text": "Kan ik tijdens de behandeling bijwerkingen ervaren?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7438d55013f15f12490d",
   "sourceHash": "7438d55013f15f12490db1ea911dccd26ec1fa6cbf45b3210b28899c4282c4e7",
   "text": "Is Panchakarma oncomfortabel, en hoe voelt een behandeldag aan?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
